# Dev-proxy target only: where Vite forwards `/api/*` requests during `pnpm dev`
# (see vite.config.ts). Has no effect on the production build.
VITE_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Prod: full public URL of the backend API (e.g. https://api.example.com/api).
# Locally not needed — the Vite proxy handles `/api` (default in code: '/api').
# VITE_API_URL=
